<title>NEW ZEALAND: NZ Post NZ$70 mln 2004 bond issue fully subscribed.</title>
<headline>NZ Post NZ$70 mln 2004 bond issue fully subscribed.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1997-03-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>A NZ$70 million issue of eight percent April 15, 2004 bonds by state-owned New Zealand Post has closed fully subscribed, lead manager Bank of New Zealand said on Monday.</p>
</text>
